**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.zed
.idea
**/.vscode
**/.zed

# Rust and ROS build products
**/target
**/target/
**/build
**/build/
**/install
**/install/
**/log
**/log/
**/compile_commands.json

